            "review_text": "bitsdewan\nNha Trang, Vietnam25 contributions\n0\nRevisit is a pleasurable experience\nJun 2019 • Friends\nRevisited this establishment. What is good is that they have improved their pricing and are competitive and comparable to others in the area. Their product range is good and an array of goods for Russian tastes is good as there are a lot of Russian residents in the area. Their food is good but service staff, although enthusiastic, need to be more attentive.. so just make sure they understand what exactly you want. The manager does her best to keep things rolling along. so overall a pleasurable experience!!!\nRead more\nReview collected in partnership with this restaurant \nWritten June 21, 2019",
